    "text": "Here, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">γ</mi><mi>ag</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>.30</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msup><mo>℃</mo><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">γ</mi><mi>am</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>.06</mo><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msup><mo>℃</mo><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msup><mo>℃</mo><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mo>?</mo></math><br /><br />Now, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">γ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">γ</mi><mi>ag</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">γ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">γ</mi><mi>am</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">γ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></msub></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>∴</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>.30</mo><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>10<